=== 6D frequency domain as C^3 (3 real cosine axes + 3 imaginary sine axes) ===
det U = (1-0j)  unitary: True
120-degree rotation of all three complex planes, det(wI) = (1-0j) -> lies in SU(3): colour triality
baryon (3 quarks, one per complex axis = complex volume) invariant: True
meson (quark x antiquark = Hermitian length) invariant: True

=== Mind -> matter: which pairings with the Higgs close (Yukawa couplings) ===
     Q x u^c   x H   hypercharge sum 0, total winding 12 (closes)
     Q x d^c   x H*  hypercharge sum 0, total winding 12 (closes)
     L x e^c   x H*  hypercharge sum 0, total winding 6 (closes)
     L x nu^c  x H   hypercharge sum 0, total winding 6 (closes)
  4 closing pairings; every charged fermion gets one; neutrinos only if nu^c is added

=== After the Higgs settles at the zero-frequency point: who stays on the null cone ===
  generator 1*T3 + 0*Y on vacuum: -1/2 
  generator 0*T3 + 1*Y on vacuum: 1/2 
  generator 1*T3 + 1*Y on vacuum: 0 <- unbroken (photon)
  generator 1*T3 + -1*Y on vacuum: -1 
  W+ and W- shift T3 by +-1, so they cannot leave the vacuum alone -> massive

